            <description><![CDATA[
<ul>
<li><strong>Safer Execute hard boundaries</strong> — caption + task checks, one-boundary approvals, scoped sensitive typing</li>
<li><strong>Cancel / captions / Dictate</strong> — intent repair cancelled on barge-in; no stale confirmations; no late Dictate paste after timeout</li>
<li><strong>Auth &amp; routing</strong> — no credential resurrection after sign-out; real force-refresh on 401; OpenAI no longer falls through during launch check</li>
<li><strong>Memory</strong> — stronger secret filters; no bare “memory” over-inject; safer SQLite save path</li>
<li><strong>Reliability</strong> — better loop detection; replace_selection requires a real selection</li>
</ul>
<p>Build 42.</p>
